{
  "id": "1SA.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samueli 26",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baadhi ya wanaume kutoka mji wa Zifu walimwendea Shauli huko Gibea wakamwambia kwamba Daudi alikuwa anajificha kwenye mlima Hakila, upande wa mashariki wa Yeshimoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara moja, Shauli alikwenda kwenye nyika za Zifu kumtafuta Daudi akiwa na askari waliochaguliwa 3,000 wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli akapiga kambi juu ya mlima Hakila, karibu na barabara, mashariki ya Yeshimoni. Lakini Daudi alikuwa bado huko nyikani. Daudi alipojua kwamba Shauli alikuwa amekuja nyikani kumtafuta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "alituma wapelelezi, akafahamishwa kwamba ni kweli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akatoka, akaenda mahali Shauli alipopiga kambi. Akapaona mahali ambapo Shauli alikuwa amelala na Abneri mwana wa Neri, kamanda wa jeshi la Shauli, alikuwa amelala karibu na Shauli. Shauli alikuwa amelala katikati ya kambi huku akizungukwa na jeshi lake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamwambia Ahimeleki ambaye alikuwa, Mhiti, na Abishai ndugu yake Yoabu (mama yao aliitwa Seruya), “Nani atakwenda pamoja nami kwenye kambi ya Shauli?” Abishai akamwambia; “Mimi nitakwenda pamoja nawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo usiku, Daudi na Abishai wakaingia kwenye kambi ya Shauli, wakamkuta Shauli amelala katikati ya kambi hiyo, na mkuki wake umechomekwa ardhini karibu na kichwa chake. Abneri pamoja na askari walikuwa wamelala kumzunguka Shauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abishai akamwambia Daudi, “Leo Mungu amemtia adui yako mikononi mwako. Basi, niache nimbane udongoni kwa pigo moja tu la mkuki; sitampiga mara mbili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Daudi akamwambia Abishai, “Usimwangamize; maana hakika Mwenyezi-Mungu atamwadhibu mtu yeyote atakayeunyosha mkono wake dhidi ya mteule wake aliyepakwa mafuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naapa kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu aliye hai, kwamba Mwenyezi-Mungu mwenyewe atamuua Sauli; ama siku yake ya kufa itafika, au atakwenda vitani na kufia huko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Mwenyezi-Mungu anakataza nisinyoshe mkono wangu dhidi ya mtu ambaye amemteua kwa kumpaka mafuta. Lakini chukua mkuki wake ulio karibu na kichwa chake pamoja na gudulia lake la maji, halafu tujiendee zetu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo, Daudi alichukua ule mkuki na gudulia la maji karibu na kichwa cha Shauli nao wakajiendea zao. Lakini hakuna mtu aliyeona au kujua tukio hilo, wala hakuna aliyeamka, kwa kuwa Mwenyezi-Mungu aliwaletea usingizi mzito.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, Daudi akaenda upande wa pili wa bonde hilo, akasimama juu mlimani mbali na kundi la Shauli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaliita kwa sauti jeshi la Shauli na Abneri mwana wa Neri akisema, “Abneri, je, unanisikia?” Abneri akauliza, “Ni nani wewe unayemwita mfalme?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akamjibu, “Je, wewe si mwanamume? Nani aliye sawa nawe katika Israeli? Mbona basi, hukumlinda bwana wako mfalme? Mtu mmoja wetu aliingia hapo kumwangamiza bwana wako mfalme! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ulilotenda si jambo jema. Ninaapa kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu aliye hai, kwamba unastahili kufa, kwa kuwa hukumlinda bwana wako, ambaye Mwenyezi-Mungu amempaka mafuta. Sasa hebu angalia, mkuki wa mfalme na lile gudulia la maji lililokuwa karibu na kichwa chake kama vipo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli alitambua sauti ya Daudi, akamwuliza, “Je, hiyo ni sauti yako mwanangu Daudi?” Daudi akamjibu, “Bwana wangu, mfalme, ni sauti yangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Halafu akaendelea kusema, “Lakini kwa nini, wewe bwana wangu unifuatilie mimi mtumishi wako? Nimefanya nini? Ni ovu gani nimekufanyia? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, sasa bwana wangu mfalme, usikie maneno ya mtumishi wako. Ikiwa Mwenyezi-Mungu ndiye aliyekuchochea uje dhidi yangu, basi, na apokee tambiko itakayomfanya abadili nia yake. Lakini kama ni watu, basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu na awalaani watu hao kwani wamenifukuza kutoka urithi aliotupa Mwenyezi-Mungu wakisema, ‘Nenda ukaitumikie miungu mingine.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Usiniache nife katika nchi ya kigeni, mbali na Mwenyezi-Mungu. Kwa nini wewe mfalme wa Israeli umetoka kuyatafuta maisha yangu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26:20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kuyatafuta maisha yangu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makala ya Kiebrania: Kutafuta kiroboto.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kama mtu anayewinda kware milimani?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Shauli akajibu, “Mimi nimefanya makosa. Rudi mwanangu Daudi. Sitakudhuru tena kwa kuwa leo maisha yangu yalikuwa ya thamani mbele yako. Mimi nimekuwa mpumbavu na nimekosa vibaya sana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi akajibu, “Ee mfalme, mkuki wako uko hapa, mtume kijana wako mmoja aje auchukue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu humtunza kila mtu kwa uadilifu na uaminifu wake. Leo Mwenyezi-Mungu alikutia mikononi mwangu, lakini mimi sikunyosha mkono wangu dhidi yako kwa kuwa wewe umeteuliwa naye kwa kutiwa mafuta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tazama kama vile leo maisha yako yalivyokuwa na thamani mbele yangu, ndivyo na maisha yangu yawe na thamani mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu; naye akaniokoe kutoka kwenye taabu zote.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shauli akamwambia Daudi, “Mungu na akubariki mwanangu Daudi. Utafanya mambo makuu, nawe utafanikiwa katika yote.” Basi, Daudi akaenda zake; Shauli naye akarudi nyumbani kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
